# LINKED LIST QUESTIONS

## 20. Reverse Linked List

```python
class Solution(object):

    def reverseList(self, head):

        prev = None
        current = head

        while current:

            next_node = current.next
            current.next = prev

            prev = current
            current = next_node

        return prev
```

---

## 21. Linked List Cycle

```python
class Solution(object):

    def hasCycle(self, head):

        slow = head
        fast = head

        while fast and fast.next:

            slow = slow.next
            fast = fast.next.next

            if slow == fast:
                return True

        return False
```

