# BINARY SEARCH

## 22. Binary Search

```python
def binarySearch(arr, target):

    left = 0
    right = len(arr) - 1

    while left <= right:

        mid = (left + right) // 2

        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid

        elif arr[mid] < target:
            left = mid + 1

        else:
            right = mid - 1

    return -1
```

Time Complexity:

```text
O(log n)
```

