# SLIDING WINDOW

## 31. Maximum Sum of K Elements

```python
def maxSum(arr, k):

    current = sum(arr[:k])
    maximum = current

    for i in range(k, len(arr)):

        current += arr[i]
        current -= arr[i - k]

        maximum = max(maximum, current)

    return maximum
```

