# SORTING

## 32. Bubble Sort

```python
def bubbleSort(arr):

    n = len(arr)

    for i in range(n):

        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):

            if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:

                arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]

    return arr
```

Time Complexity:

```text
O(n²)
```

